shuffle=True if the dataset is</span></span><span lang=EN-US style='color:black;
mso-color-alt:windowtext'><br>
</span></span><span style='mso-bookmark:response-29'><span class=VerbatimChar><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;color:black;
mso-color-alt:windowtext'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                                     </span># not
already shuffled</span></span><span lang=EN-US style='color:black;mso-color-alt:
windowtext'><br>
</span></span><span style='mso-bookmark:response-29'><span class=VerbatimChar><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;color:black;
mso-color-alt:windowtext'>for train_index, test_index in skfolds.split(X_train,
