     style='font-family:"Cambria Math",serif'>TP</span></i></m:r></span></m:num><m:den><span
    style='mso-bookmark:response-29'><m:r><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
     lang=EN-US style='font-family:"Cambria Math",serif'>TP</span></i></m:r></span><span
    style='mso-bookmark:response-29'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty
       m:val="p"/></m:rPr><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:"Cambria Math",serif'>+</span></m:r><m:r><i
     style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:
     "Cambria Math",serif'>FP</span></i></m:r></span></m:den></m:f></m:oMath></m:oMathPara><![endif]--><![if !msEquation]><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
