mso-color-alt:windowtext'>y_train_pred = cross_val_predict(sgd_clf,
X_train_scaled, y_train, cv=3)</span></span><span lang=EN-US style='color:black;
mso-color-alt:windowtext'><br>
</span></span><span style='mso-bookmark:response-32'><span class=VerbatimChar><span
