<p class=FirstParagraph><span style='mso-bookmark:response-37'><span
lang=EN-US>Sau đây là một ví dụ đơn giản với Scikit-Learn sử dụng lớp </span></span><span
style='mso-bookmark:response-37'><span class=VerbatimChar><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Lasso</span></span><span
lang=EN-US>:</span></span></p>

<p class=SourceCode><span style='mso-bookmark:response-37'><span
class=VerbatimChar><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
12.0pt;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext'>&gt;&gt;&gt; from
sklearn.linear_model import Lasso</span></span><span lang=EN-US
style='color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext'><br>
</span></span><span style='mso-bookmark:response-37'><span class=VerbatimChar><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;color:black;
mso-color-alt:windowtext'>&gt;&gt;&gt; lasso_reg = Lasso(alpha=0.1)</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext'><br>
</span></span><span style='mso-bookmark:response-37'><span class=VerbatimChar><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;color:black;
