</v:shape></span><![endif]><span style='mso-bookmark:response-39'><span
lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>mà thuật toán phải tìm. Trong
ví dụ này, rõ ràng khi nhìn vào dữ liệu rằng </span></span><span
style='mso-bookmark:response-39'></span><!--[if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMath><span
 style='mso-bookmark:response-39'><m:r><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
  lang=EN-US style='font-family:"Cambria Math",serif'>k</span></i></m:r></span></m:oMath><![endif]--><![if !msEquation]><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;
